{"id":"22c2c4cecc692616","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-settheoretic-language.md","title":"Membership Language and ZF Axioms","display":"df-settheoretic-language — Membership Language and ZF Axioms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-settheoretic-language","aliases":["89-df-settheoretic-language"],"display":"df-settheoretic-language — Membership Language and ZF Axioms","depends_on":["[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-function]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","[[89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-settheoretic-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-settheoretic-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-settheoretic-language — Membership Language and ZF Axioms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1076c7ed1730eab7\" href=\"?note=1076c7ed1730eab7\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation\">89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>元理论为 ZFC。对象语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 只有等号与二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>，没有常元或函数符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,u,a,b,I,f\">\\(x,y,z,u,a,b,I,f\\)</span> 为互异变量，模式中的辅助变量总取满足所列新鲜条件的最小指标。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in a\\,B\">\\(\\forall x\\in a\\,B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\in a\\,B\">\\(\\exists x\\in a\\,B\\)</span> 分别展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(x\\in a\\to B)\">\\(\\forall x(x\\in a\\to B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x(x\\in a\\land B)\">\\(\\exists x(x\\in a\\land B)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\subseteq y\">\\(x\\subseteq y\\)</span> 展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall z(z\\in x\\to z\\in y)\">\\(\\forall z(z\\in x\\to z\\in y)\\)</span>。有序对、函数、函数值、幂集、并集、空集等在对象公式中仅为其唯一图定义的缩写，不是新增符号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)\">\\(\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)\\)</span> 是一个公式族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 为元自然数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi[\\bar n/x]\">\\(\\psi[\\bar n/x]\\)</span> 使用下述公式实例化，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 误当作纯集合论语言中的项。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>编码采用通用一阶编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_P(\\in)=0\">\\(\\kappa_P(\\in)=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}\">\\(\\mathrm{ucl}\\)</span> 为已有自由变元全称闭合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> 是以下明确的对象公理集合，区别于本条使用的元理论。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对象图缩写实际调用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1076c7ed1730eab7\" href=\"?note=1076c7ed1730eab7\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation\">89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation</a> 的模板与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SetExp}\">\\(\\mathsf{SetExp}\\)</span>。本条及后续条目的新模板按依赖顺序加入同一登记表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_\\in\">\\(g_\\in\\)</span> 只接受已展开的纯公式。元层码集合不作为对象语言常元；本条只建立语言、公理及其元层编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下列定义式的右端若有已登记图缩写，公式值为其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ObForm}\">\\(\\mathsf{ObForm}\\)</span>；该操作不作用于元层集合构造或替换函数本身。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathsf{Sep},\\mathsf{Rep}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathsf{Sep},\\mathsf{Rep}\\)</span> 的成员逐个取该公式值，然后才形成元层公理集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ObForm}\">\\(\\mathsf{ObForm}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CodeIn}\">\\(\\mathsf{CodeIn}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SetExp}\">\\(\\mathsf{SetExp}\\)</span> 使用同一调用环境显式指定的登记表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span>；本条实例取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+}\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+}\\)</span>。后续调用可以使用其文件显示的合法扩展表；旧调用的值由登记扩展不变性保持。下述带表下标版本仅显示原有隐式参数，不替换原来的无下标接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_\\in&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\in\\},\\{(\\in,2)\\}),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\quad\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\\\\ng_\\in&amp;\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L_\\in},\\quad\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in],\\quad\\mathsf{SC}_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Empty}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall z\\neg(z\\in x),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\forall z(z\\in y\\leftrightarrow z\\in x\\lor z=x),\\\\\n\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)&amp;\\coloneqq[\\exists z(\\mathsf{Empty}(z)\\land z\\in I)]\\land\n[\\forall x\\in I\\ \\exists y\\in I\\ \\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Omega}(N)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{IndSet}(N)\\land\\forall I(\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)\\to N\\subseteq I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Num}_0(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Empty}(z),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Num}_{n+1}(z)\\coloneqq\\exists u(\\mathsf{Num}_n(u)\\land\\mathsf{Succ}(u,z)),\\\\\n\\psi[\\bar n/x]&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z(\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)\\land\\psi[x:=z])\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(\\psi)\\cup\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ext}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\forall y((\\forall z(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y))\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EmpAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\ \\mathsf{Empty}(x),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PairAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\forall y\\exists a\\forall z(z\\in a\\leftrightarrow z=x\\lor z=y),\\\\\n\\mathsf{UnionAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\land x\\in y)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PowAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow x\\subseteq a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists I\\ \\mathsf{IndSet}(I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FoundAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall a(\\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(a)\\to\\exists x\\in a\\ \\forall y\\in x\\ \\neg(y\\in a)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sep}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}(\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow x\\in a\\land A))\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ x,a\\in\\mathsf V,\\ x\\ne a,\\ b\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus(\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x,a\\})\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rep}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}(\\forall a((\\forall x\\in a\\ \\exists!y\\ A)\\to\\exists b\\forall y(y\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in a\\ A)))\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ x,y\\in\\mathsf V,\\ x\\ne y,\\ a,b\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus(\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\ a\\ne b\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Ext},\\mathsf{EmpAx},\\mathsf{PairAx},\\mathsf{UnionAx},\\mathsf{PowAx},\\mathsf{InfAx},\\mathsf{FoundAx}\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Rep},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AC}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall a\\bigl((\\forall x\\in a\\ \\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(x))\\to\n\\exists f(\\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=a\\land\\forall x\\in a\\ f(x)\\in x)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZFC}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{AxCode}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{ZF}],\\quad\\bot_\\in\\coloneqq\\exists x\\neg(x=x),\\\\\nT\\vdash A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_\\in}A\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in),\\\\\n\\exists!y\\ A&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists y(A\\land\\forall z(A[y:=z]\\to z=y))\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{y\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_\\in&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\in\\},\\{(\\in,2)\\}),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\quad\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\\\\ng_\\in&amp;\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L_\\in},\\quad\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in],\\quad\\mathsf{SC}_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Empty}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall z\\neg(z\\in x),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\forall z(z\\in y\\leftrightarrow z\\in x\\lor z=x),\\\\\n\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)&amp;\\coloneqq[\\exists z(\\mathsf{Empty}(z)\\land z\\in I)]\\land\n[\\forall x\\in I\\ \\exists y\\in I\\ \\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Omega}(N)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{IndSet}(N)\\land\\forall I(\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)\\to N\\subseteq I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Num}_0(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Empty}(z),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Num}_{n+1}(z)\\coloneqq\\exists u(\\mathsf{Num}_n(u)\\land\\mathsf{Succ}(u,z)),\\\\\n\\psi[\\bar n/x]&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z(\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)\\land\\psi[x:=z])\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(\\psi)\\cup\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ext}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\forall y((\\forall z(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y))\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EmpAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\ \\mathsf{Empty}(x),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PairAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\forall y\\exists a\\forall z(z\\in a\\leftrightarrow z=x\\lor z=y),\\\\\n\\mathsf{UnionAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\land x\\in y)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PowAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow x\\subseteq a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists I\\ \\mathsf{IndSet}(I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FoundAx}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall a(\\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(a)\\to\\exists x\\in a\\ \\forall y\\in x\\ \\neg(y\\in a)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sep}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}(\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow x\\in a\\land A))\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ x,a\\in\\mathsf V,\\ x\\ne a,\\ b\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus(\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x,a\\})\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rep}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}(\\forall a((\\forall x\\in a\\ \\exists!y\\ A)\\to\\exists b\\forall y(y\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in a\\ A)))\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ x,y\\in\\mathsf V,\\ x\\ne y,\\ a,b\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus(\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\ a\\ne b\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Ext},\\mathsf{EmpAx},\\mathsf{PairAx},\\mathsf{UnionAx},\\mathsf{PowAx},\\mathsf{InfAx},\\mathsf{FoundAx}\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Rep},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AC}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall a\\bigl((\\forall x\\in a\\ \\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(x))\\to\n\\exists f(\\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=a\\land\\forall x\\in a\\ f(x)\\in x)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZFC}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{AxCode}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{ZF}],\\quad\\bot_\\in\\coloneqq\\exists x\\neg(x=x),\\\\\nT\\vdash A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_\\in}A\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in),\\\\\n\\exists!y\\ A&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists y(A\\land\\forall z(A[y:=z]\\to z=y))\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{y\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{SetExp}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodeIn}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq g_\\in(\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A))\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ObForm}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{CodeIn}(A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{CodeIn}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall x(\\mathsf{Empty}(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf E_0(x))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall x\\forall y(\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf S_0(x,y))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall N(\\mathsf{Omega}(N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf N_0(N))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{AC}\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall a\\left[\n(\\forall x\\in a\\ \\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(x))\\to\n\\exists f\\left(\\mathsf{Fn}_0(f)\\land\\mathsf{Dom}_0(f,a)\\land\n\\forall x\\in a\\ \\exists y(\\mathsf{App}_0(f,x,y)\\land y\\in x)\\right)\\right]\\right)\\right),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZF}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\quad\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\\\\n\\psi[\\bar n/x]&amp;=\\exists z(\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)\\land\\psi[x:=z]),\\quad\nz=\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\psi)\\cup\\{x\\},1)_0.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{SetExp}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodeIn}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq g_\\in(\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A))\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ObForm}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{CodeIn}(A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{CodeIn}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall x(\\mathsf{Empty}(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf E_0(x))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall x\\forall y(\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf S_0(x,y))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall N(\\mathsf{Omega}(N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf N_0(N))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&amp;\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{AC}\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall a\\left[\n(\\forall x\\in a\\ \\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(x))\\to\n\\exists f\\left(\\mathsf{Fn}_0(f)\\land\\mathsf{Dom}_0(f,a)\\land\n\\forall x\\in a\\ \\exists y(\\mathsf{App}_0(f,x,y)\\land y\\in x)\\right)\\right]\\right)\\right),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZF}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\quad\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\\\\n\\psi[\\bar n/x]&amp;=\\exists z(\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)\\land\\psi[x:=z]),\\quad\nz=\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\psi)\\cup\\{x\\},1)_0.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Empty},\\langle x\\rangle,\\mathsf{Empty}(x)) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Succ},\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{IndSet},\\langle I\\rangle,\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Omega},\\langle N\\rangle,\\mathsf{Omega}(N)) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Ext},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{Ext}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{EmpAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{EmpAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{PairAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{PairAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{UnionAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{UnionAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{PowAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{PowAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{InfAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{InfAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{FoundAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{FoundAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathrm{AC},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathrm{AC})\\},\\\\\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Empty},\\langle x\\rangle,\\mathsf{Empty}(x)) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Succ},\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{IndSet},\\langle I\\rangle,\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Omega},\\langle N\\rangle,\\mathsf{Omega}(N)) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Ext},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{Ext}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{EmpAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{EmpAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{PairAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{PairAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{UnionAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{UnionAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{PowAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{PowAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{InfAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{InfAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{FoundAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{FoundAx}) ,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathrm{AC},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathrm{AC})\\},\\\\\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal B\\cup\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Num}_n,\\langle z\\rangle,\\mathsf{Num}_n(z))\\mid n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal D&amp;=\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+},\\quad\\mathsf{Admissible}(\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal B\\cup\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Num}_n,\\langle z\\rangle,\\mathsf{Num}_n(z))\\mid n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal D&amp;=\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+},\\quad\\mathsf{Admissible}(\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>ZF 公理模式是可枚举的对象公式集合；不把“所有 ZF 真命题”作为公理。元语言数码与对象语言数词严格区分：纯 ∈ 语言中用 Num_n 的唯一对象实例化。对象缩写按显示公式和函数图展开，选择公理只加入 ZFC，不加入 ZF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation","status":"resolved","id":"1076c7ed1730eab7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation","status":"resolved","id":"1076c7ed1730eab7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对象图缩写实际调用 [[89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation]] 的模板与 $\\mathsf{SetExp}$。本条及后续条目的新模板按依赖顺序加入同一登记表；$g_\\in$ 只接受已展开的纯公式。元层码集合不作为对象语言常元；本条只建立语言、公理及其元层编码。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z,u,a,b,I,f","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in a\\,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\in a\\,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x(x\\in a\\to B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x(x\\in a\\land B)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\subseteq y","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall z(z\\in x\\to z\\in y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi[\\bar n/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_P(\\in)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ucl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SetExp}","display":false},{"tex":"g_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ObForm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathsf{Sep},\\mathsf{Rep}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ObForm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CodeIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SetExp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_\\in&\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\in\\},\\{(\\in,2)\\}),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\quad\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\\\\ng_\\in&\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L_\\in},\\quad\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in],\\quad\\mathsf{SC}_\\in\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Empty}(x)&\\coloneqq\\forall z\\neg(z\\in x),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\forall z(z\\in y\\leftrightarrow z\\in x\\lor z=x),\\\\\n\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)&\\coloneqq[\\exists z(\\mathsf{Empty}(z)\\land z\\in I)]\\land\n[\\forall x\\in I\\ \\exists y\\in I\\ \\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Omega}(N)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{IndSet}(N)\\land\\forall I(\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)\\to N\\subseteq I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Num}_0(z)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Empty}(z),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Num}_{n+1}(z)\\coloneqq\\exists u(\\mathsf{Num}_n(u)\\land\\mathsf{Succ}(u,z)),\\\\\n\\psi[\\bar n/x]&\\coloneqq\\exists z(\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)\\land\\psi[x:=z])\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(\\psi)\\cup\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ext}&\\coloneqq\\forall x\\forall y((\\forall z(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y))\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EmpAx}&\\coloneqq\\exists x\\ \\mathsf{Empty}(x),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PairAx}&\\coloneqq\\forall x\\forall y\\exists a\\forall z(z\\in a\\leftrightarrow z=x\\lor z=y),\\\\\n\\mathsf{UnionAx}&\\coloneqq\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\land x\\in y)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PowAx}&\\coloneqq\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow x\\subseteq a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfAx}&\\coloneqq\\exists I\\ \\mathsf{IndSet}(I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FoundAx}&\\coloneqq\\forall a(\\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(a)\\to\\exists x\\in a\\ \\forall y\\in x\\ \\neg(y\\in a)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sep}&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}(\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow x\\in a\\land A))\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ x,a\\in\\mathsf V,\\ x\\ne a,\\ b\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus(\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x,a\\})\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rep}&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}(\\forall a((\\forall x\\in a\\ \\exists!y\\ A)\\to\\exists b\\forall y(y\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in a\\ A)))\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ x,y\\in\\mathsf V,\\ x\\ne y,\\ a,b\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus(\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\ a\\ne b\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Ext},\\mathsf{EmpAx},\\mathsf{PairAx},\\mathsf{UnionAx},\\mathsf{PowAx},\\mathsf{InfAx},\\mathsf{FoundAx}\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Rep},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AC}&\\coloneqq\\forall a\\bigl((\\forall x\\in a\\ \\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(x))\\to\n\\exists f(\\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=a\\land\\forall x\\in a\\ f(x)\\in x)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZFC}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{AxCode}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\coloneqq g_\\in[\\mathrm{ZF}],\\quad\\bot_\\in\\coloneqq\\exists x\\neg(x=x),\\\\\nT\\vdash A&\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_\\in}A\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in),\\\\\n\\exists!y\\ A&\\coloneqq\\exists y(A\\land\\forall z(A[y:=z]\\to z=y))\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{y\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{SetExp}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodeIn}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&\\coloneqq g_\\in(\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A))\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ObForm}(A)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ObForm}_{\\mathcal D}(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{CodeIn}(A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{CodeIn}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Call}_{\\mathcal D}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall x(\\mathsf{Empty}(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf E_0(x))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall x\\forall y(\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf S_0(x,y))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&\\vdash\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall N(\\mathsf{Omega}(N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf N_0(N))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZF}&\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{AC}\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{ObForm}\\left(\\forall a\\left[\n(\\forall x\\in a\\ \\neg\\mathsf{Empty}(x))\\to\n\\exists f\\left(\\mathsf{Fn}_0(f)\\land\\mathsf{Dom}_0(f,a)\\land\n\\forall x\\in a\\ \\exists y(\\mathsf{App}_0(f,x,y)\\land y\\in x)\\right)\\right]\\right)\\right),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{ZF}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\quad\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\\\\n\\psi[\\bar n/x]&=\\exists z(\\mathsf{Num}_n(z)\\land\\psi[x:=z]),\\quad\nz=\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\psi)\\cup\\{x\\},1)_0.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Empty},\\langle x\\rangle,\\mathsf{Empty}(x)) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Succ},\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\mathsf{Succ}(x,y)) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{IndSet},\\langle I\\rangle,\\mathsf{IndSet}(I)) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Omega},\\langle N\\rangle,\\mathsf{Omega}(N)) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Ext},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{Ext}) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{EmpAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{EmpAx}) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{PairAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{PairAx}) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{UnionAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{UnionAx}) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{PowAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{PowAx}) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{InfAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{InfAx}) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{FoundAx},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathsf{FoundAx}) ,\\\\\n&\\qquad \\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathrm{AC},\\langle \\rangle,\\mathrm{AC})\\},\\\\\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+}&\\coloneqq\\mathcal B\\cup\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf{RegR}(\\mathsf{Num}_n,\\langle z\\rangle,\\mathsf{Num}_n(z))\\mid n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal D&=\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+},\\quad\\mathsf{Admissible}(\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":8179,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf85e6f6750f6f5e","anchor":"ref-1","location